<item><title>Lake Chad experts urge customs reforms for cross-border trade</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/lake-chad-experts-urge-customs-reforms-for-cross-border-9edf92/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/lake-chad-experts-urge-customs-reforms-for-cross-border-9edf92/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The proposed changes include one-stop border posts and rules tailored to small businesses as insecurity and informal trade constrain a market of about 30 million people.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:41:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad weighs income alternatives for disabled workers displaced from Nguéli bridge</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-weighs-income-alternatives-for-disabled-workers-2ffd1b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-weighs-income-alternatives-for-disabled-workers-2ffd1b/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>A three-day N’Djamena workshop proposed entrepreneurship, small trade, vocational training and access to finance after restructuring halted workers’ activities.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:36:27 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad project trains Sarh women and girls in online sales</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-project-trains-sarh-women-and-girls-in-online-sales-f0c131/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-project-trains-sarh-women-and-girls-in-online-sales-f0c131/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The session covered phone basics and internet safety, with participants learning to market products on social media without a shop.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:00:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad appoints prefects and sub-prefects in three provinces</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-appoints-prefects-and-sub-prefects-in-three-provinces-f9c73f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-appoints-prefects-and-sub-prefects-in-three-provinces-f9c73f/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>A decree signed on 18 November names officials to posts in Wadi-Fira, Tibesti and Kanem after the president’s provincial tour.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:19:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-appoints-prefects-and-sub-prefects-in-three-provinces-f9c73f/share.jpg" length="42832" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-appoints-prefects-and-sub-prefects-in-three-provinces-f9c73f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad reviews national rollout of its basic education project, SMARTED</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-reviews-national-rollout-of-its-basic-education-60afc8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-reviews-national-rollout-of-its-basic-education-60afc8/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The programme, launched on 16 November, covers all 23 provinces and includes classroom construction and teacher training.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:15:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
